<section class="spares-section" id="repuestos">
    <div class="spares-intro">
        <div class="section-kicker dark" style="color: var(--color-yellow);" data-reveal>Soporte y Mantenimiento</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" data-reveal>Repuestos y Reacondicionamiento</h2>
        <p class="section-subtitle" data-reveal>Aseguramos la m&aacute;xima operatividad de sus equipos con repuestos originales de alta precisi&oacute;n y un servicio experto enfocado en su productividad.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Parallax Carousel Container -->
    <div class="spares-carousel-container" data-reveal>
        <div class="spares-carousel">
            
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="parallax-card">
                <!-- Fondo temporal (placeholder) -->
                <div class="parallax-bg" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);"></div>
                <div class="parallax-overlay"></div>
                <div class="parallax-content">
                    <div class="card-kicker">01. Originalidad</div>
                    <h3>Repuestos L&iacute;nea RG</h3>
                    <p>Piezas originales fabricadas bajo m&aacute;xima exigencia. Garantizamos calce perfecto y durabilidad prolongada para mantener su producci&oacute;n sin interrupciones.</p>
                    <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-gold">Consultar Stock</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="parallax-card">
                <!-- Fondo temporal (placeholder) -->
                <div class="parallax-bg" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #141e30, #243b55);"></div>
                <div class="parallax-overlay"></div>
                <div class="parallax-content">
                    <div class="card-kicker">02. Ahorro y Garant&iacute;a</div>
                    <h3>Reacondicionamiento</h3>
                    <p>No descarte su embrague desgastado. Nuestros t&eacute;cnicos expertos lo desarman, eval&uacute;an y restauran dej&aacute;ndolo con rendimiento y apariencia de 0km.</p>
                    <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-gold">Solicitar Presupuesto</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3 (Urvig con 3 imagenes rotativas) -->
            <div class="parallax-card">
                <div class="urvig-crossfade">
                    <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/platoconcono_urvig.jpeg');"></div>
                    <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/platodesplazable_urvig.jpeg');"></div>
                    <div class="crossfade-bg" style="background-image: url('/portacollar_urvig.jpeg');"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="parallax-overlay"></div>
                <div class="parallax-content">
                    <div class="card-kicker">03. Compatibilidad Total</div>
                    <h3>Repuestos Urvig y Micron</h3>
                    <p>Soluciones multimarca. Disponemos de un amplio stock de repuestos compatibles de alt&iacute;sima precisi&oacute;n para sistemas Urvig y Micron, con entrega r&aacute;pida.</p>
                    <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-gold">Ver Compatibilidad</a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .spares-section {
        background-color: var(--color-dark);
        color: var(--color-surface);
        padding: 100px 0;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .spares-intro {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto 60px;
        padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .spares-intro .section-title {
        color: var(--color-surface);
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    
    .spares-intro .section-title:after {
        color: var(--color-yellow);
    }
    
    .spares-intro .section-subtitle {
        color: #94a3b8;
    }

    /* Carousel */
    .spares-carousel-container {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 0 20px 40px;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .spares-carousel {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
        overflow-x: auto;
        scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        padding-bottom: 30px; /* space for scrollbar */
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
        scrollbar-width: thin;
        scrollbar-color: var(--color-primary) rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    
    .spares-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar {
        height: 6px;
    }
    .spares-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .spares-carousel::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: var(--color-primary);
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Parallax Card */
    .parallax-card {
        flex: 0 0 85vw; /* full screen minus peeking edge on mobile */
        height: 480px;
        position: relative;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        scroll-snap-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-end;
        cursor: grab;
    }
    
    .parallax-card:active {
        cursor: grabbing;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .parallax-card {
            flex: 0 0 380px;
            height: 560px;
            scroll-snap-align: start;
        }
        .spares-carousel {
            gap: 30px;
            padding-left: calc(50vw - 600px); /* Adjust based on container */
        }
        .spares-carousel-container {
            padding-left: 0;
            padding-right: 0;
        }
    }
    
    @media (min-width: 1280px) {
        .spares-carousel {
            justify-content: center; /* Center cards perfectly on ultra-wide */
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
    }

    /* Fixed zoom issue: removed background-attachment: fixed */
    .parallax-bg {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
    }
    
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
        .parallax-card:hover .parallax-bg {
            transform: scale(1.05); /* Premium zoom hover */
        }
    }

    /* Urvig Crossfade */
    .urvig-crossfade {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
    }

    .crossfade-bg {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background-size: cover;
        background-position: center;
        opacity: 0;
        animation: crossfadeAnim 12s infinite;
        transition: transform 0.8s ease;
    }

    .parallax-card:hover .crossfade-bg {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .crossfade-bg:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0s; }
    .crossfade-bg:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 4s; }
    .crossfade-bg:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 8s; }

    @keyframes crossfadeAnim {
        0% { opacity: 0; }
        8% { opacity: 1; }
        33% { opacity: 1; }
        41% { opacity: 0; }
        100% { opacity: 0; }
    }

    .parallax-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(3, 26, 47, 0.98) 0%, rgba(3, 26, 47, 0.6) 50%, rgba(3, 26, 47, 0.1) 100%);
        z-index: 1;
        transition: background 0.5s ease;
    }

    .parallax-card:hover .parallax-overlay {
        background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(3, 26, 47, 0.98) 0%, rgba(3, 26, 47, 0.8) 60%, rgba(3, 26, 47, 0.3) 100%);
    }

    .parallax-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 2;
        padding: 40px 30px;
        width: 100%;
        transform: translateY(15px);
        transition: transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    
    .parallax-card:hover .parallax-content {
        transform: translateY(0);
    }

    .card-kicker {
        color: var(--color-yellow);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .parallax-content h3 {
        color: #fff;
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        line-height: 1.15;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-stretch: 75%;
    }

    .parallax-content p {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .parallax-card:hover .parallax-content p {
        color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    }

    .parallax-content .btn {
        width: 100%;
        opacity: 0.85;
    }

    .parallax-card:hover .parallax-content .btn {
        opacity: 1;
    }
</style>
